  "scientific_summary": "382297 uncredited formal r22 COMPLETE FOR ITS SCOPE. Root verified from receipts: Bun.state_endpoint, for all n u j with u<=j<n, the number of window assignments with j in the layer-true state set is at most the number with j in the layer-false set, with no added premise. Eight new modules (Rows, FiberSums, ActualCounts, CountLaw, Compressed, Dominance, Payoff, Final) have compile, kernel and hash evidence on top of twenty sealed modules, and thirty audited theorems use only propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. Twenty-three failed compile attempts retained with true exits. Unpaid for the campaign: the literal Reach bridge, the window-to-full-outcome factor, the literal endpoint theorem, a fresh empty-build replay of the whole chain, independent formal audit and paper. Credit 0, 57/80. 220 manifest files, 63 frozen bindings.",
